**** Boot reconcile (state comparison)
No event hooks: add/delete detection is a boot diff of on-disk keys
vs `.known-keys` (last boot's record), so shell rm, manual moves,
git checkouts, and future paths all reconcile on next boot.
Vault drawers keep live values — only static-sentinel lines for gone
keys are stripped (live leftovers are logged, never deleted).
